  "area": "id_pillar_pandemicas",
  "set": {
   "descent_text": "The original three pitches go down by rappel. Rappel from a single bolt to the anchor in the notch, then rappel down the side of the first pillar to the ledges. For the two upper pitches, descend off the right into a steep slot gully, downclimb to a single bolt on the right wall, and rappel from there to more downclimbing. Rock in the slot is loose, so keep the ropes clear when pulling them."
